WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:10.213
This is the real trainer Messages surface.

2
00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:18.559
Search for the correct client thread.

3
00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:30.395
Read the recent conversation before replying.

4
00:00:30.395 --> 00:00:38.437
Write one clear and useful message.

5
00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:53.633
Start a new thread only for an assigned client.

6
00:00:53.633 --> 00:01:01.976
Retry a failed message and verify it sent.

7
00:01:01.976 --> 00:01:08.983
Keep client communication inside JF Coach.

8
00:01:08.983 --> 00:01:15.550
Confirm the client before every send.

